<title>NETHERLANDS: POLL - Dutch company results week of July 21.</title>
<headline>POLL - Dutch company results week of July 21.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch company results for the week of July 21:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>22/7  PolyGram    Q2 97   net ord ops    154     135/164    148</p>
<p>22/7  PolyGram    H1 97   net ord ops    276     257/286    272</p>
<p>23/7  Baan	  Q2 97   net ord ops     16	13/19	 7</p>
<p>23/7  Baan	  H1 97   net ord ops     28	25/32	11</p>
<p>23/7  ASM Litho   H1 97   net ord ops     99	95/105    101</p>
<p>24/7  Philips     Q2 97   net ord ops    490     429/540    304</p>
<p>24/7  Philips     H1 97   net ord ops    951     889/1000   681</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They are stated before deduction of preference dividends where applicable.</p>
<p>BAAN estimates are in U.S. dollars</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Amstgeld, Delta Lloyd Bank, Generale Bank, ING Barings, Kempen &amp; Co, Labouchere, Van Lanschot, NIB Securities, Rabo/IRIS.</p>
